  "totalBlocks": 15,
  "translatedBlocks": 15,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d3365a8457735a1",
      "translationZh": "我开发这个开源 AI 工作流自动化平台已经有一段时间了，大部分时候都是我一个人在做。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "59e8163e5a51ea65",
      "translationZh": "我最近查看了遥测仪表盘，看到 38 个独立的平台部署实例共产生了 1,062 条遥测事件，说实话挺意外的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61985f4794484667",
      "translationZh": "这个项目已经从一个规模相对较小的工作流执行器，发展成了一个具备工作流、分支、工具、智能体记忆、文档 RAG、调度、webhooks 和可视化工作流构建器的平台。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d1dea206364867b",
      "translationZh": "现在，我开始更少地考虑“接下来该开发什么功能？”，而更多地考虑“随着真正使用它的人越来越多，我该怎样避免把现有功能弄坏？”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3eb39a07df3232b1",
      "translationZh": "想请教那些维护过开源项目、而且项目开始有人实际使用的朋友：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27ccc8bd878e1255",
      "translationZh": "有哪些东西是你们希望自己当初能更早建立起来的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "65128ad57e0727e2",
      "translationZh": "更改工作流格式时，你们如何处理向后兼容性？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6daa08495c84deba",
      "translationZh": "你们会在什么时候开始认真考虑迁移问题？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1f6c53ae7d9d6e91",
      "translationZh": "如何安全地推出更新，而不破坏现有安装？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "35f8754296694168",
      "translationZh": "什么样的遥测/可观测性才真正有用？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e271e947a3e31b37",
      "translationZh": "对于来自你无法复现的环境的错误报告，你会如何处理？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2cb95f2046d2bb8f",
      "translationZh": "当你的项目从“少数人试用”发展到实际部署时，你犯过哪些错误吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2fd70fe515c55066",
      "translationZh": "我尤其想了解维护自托管/开源基础设施的人所积累的经验，因为用户掌控着各自的安装实例，而我无法直接向所有人推送更新。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50c78a1ff31ce3ae",
      "translationZh": "如果能听到大家通过吃苦头才学到的教训，我会非常感激。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89c2f725faca6c94",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Feathered-Beast 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
